WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.760
Just follow

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.560
along step by step.

4
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.100
Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small, ready to drink bottles.

5
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.320
You'll drink each bottle straight.

6
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.220
The day before your colonoscopy, between 5 and 9 pm, you'll drink your first

7
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:16.640
bottle

8
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.960
of ClenPIQ right from the bottle.

9
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:23.160
After you finish it, drink 5 cups of clear liquid over the next 3 to 5 hours.

10
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.940
Remember, no red, orange, blue or purple liquids.

11
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.680
For your second dose, 6 hours before your procedure time, drink your second

12
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:31.260
bottle of

13
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.560
ClenPIQ.

14
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.080
After finishing it, drink 4 to 8 ounces of clear liquid every 15 minutes.

15
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.220
After that, do not drink anything else.

16
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.060
If your procedure is scheduled for early morning, you will need to get up

17
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:43.900
during the night to

18
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.620
take this second dose.

19
00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:49.700
The correct timing of this dose is essential to an effective preparation.

20
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:54.220
Do not have any liquids at all within 4 hours of your procedure.

21
00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.570
This part is really important: you must drink all of the prep solution as

22
00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.440
directed, even

23
00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.780
if you're already passing clear liquid.

24
00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.190
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

25
00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:04.900
the clearest

26
00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.820
few during your procedure.

27
00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:10.500
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

28
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:10.620
of

29
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.060
us wants that.

30
00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:15.500
Drink as many clear liquids as possible throughout the process.

31
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.900
Hydration is important, and it's actually part of the prep.

32
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.190
Make sure to hydrate before you take the prep, while you're taking the prep,

33
00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:21.700
but nothing

34
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.500
after your second dose.

35
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.020
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

36
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:27.900
a petroleum-based

37
00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.380
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

38
00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.500
That's it, you've got this.

39
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.260
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

40
00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.630
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office, we're here

41
00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:40.140
to help.
